2026-07-01 @ 16:30 - [Fix – Browser agent still not injected: SCRIPT_NAME + Frontend start]:
  Root cause (full): the PHP probe has two independent injection gates.
  Gate 1: the very first PHP opcode of the entry script must be a non-include
  opcode; if it is an include (op 61/62/136), the probe enters include-tracking
  mode and never emits "Frontend start" — BA injection is skipped entirely.
  Gate 2: SCRIPT_NAME (not REQUEST_URI) must not be index.php or bare / — the
  probe treats those as null segments.  A plain mod_rewrite → index.php mapping
  fails Gate 1 (first opcode is require_once) and Gate 2 (SCRIPT_NAME=index.php).
  Fix: per-page wrapper files (app/src/shop.php, basket.php, product.php,
  checkout.php, order.php, login.php, logout.php, admin.php, info.php, db.php,
  dxo2.php — 11 new files).  Each wrapper runs:
    $_GET['page'] ??= basename(__FILE__, '.php');  // non-include opcode
    require __DIR__ . '/index.php';
  The null-coalescing assignment compiles to non-include opcodes and runs before
  the require, triggering "Frontend start: /shop.php".  SCRIPT_NAME=/shop.php
  passes Gate 2; REQUEST_URI=/shop is used for the cookie name
  (x-apm-brtm-response-bt-page-shop).
  src/apache-php/config/vhost.conf: rewrite target changed from
  /index.php?page=$1 to /$1.php?page=$1 so Apache passes requests to the
  wrapper files (SCRIPT_NAME=/shop.php) instead of the front controller directly.
  bug_php_probe.md: updated with complete diagnosis and final fix.
  CLAUDE.md: updated front-controller description and browser-agent section.
  COMPATIBILITY.md: updated browser-agent section with SCRIPT_NAME note.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2026-07-01 @ 15:00 - [Fix – Browser agent not injected in front-controller app]:
  src/apache-php/config/vhost.conf: added RewriteEngine On + two RewriteRules
  inside the <Directory> block.  Bare / redirects to /shop (302).  Clean URL
  pattern ^([a-z][a-z0-9_-]*)$ rewrites /shop, /basket, /product, /login, etc.
  to index.php?page=<slug> via an internal rewrite [L,QSA].
  Root cause (partial): the PHP probe extracts the last URL path segment to name
  its browser-agent cookie.  It treats bare / and the filename index.php as null
  segments and skips BA injection silently.  Clean URLs give the probe a
  meaningful segment (shop, basket, product, …) on every page request.
  app/src/templates/layout.php: all href="?page=…" → href="/…" (absolute clean
  URLs); sidebar brand/cap filter links → /shop?brand=… and /shop?cap=….
  app/src/pages/shop.php: filter form action → /shop; hidden page input removed;
  pagination params: page key removed, hrefs → /shop?….
  app/src/pages/product.php: breadcrumb and back-button hrefs → /shop, /shop?brand=…;
  add-to-basket form action → /basket; redirect → /shop.
  app/src/pages/basket.php: PRG redirect → /basket; shop/checkout links updated.
  app/src/pages/checkout.php: redirects → /basket, /order?id=…; link → /basket.
  app/src/pages/order.php: redirect → /login; shop/order-detail links updated.
  app/src/pages/login.php: redirects → /shop and /<slug>.
  app/src/pages/logout.php: redirect → /shop.
  app/src/pages/admin.php: PRG redirect → /admin.
  app/src/lib/auth.php: auth_require_login redirect → /login.
  app/src/usecases/locked.php: redirect → /login.
  README.md: route table updated from ?page=… to /…; browser-agent row updated
  with clean URL requirement note; /login direct link and admin diagnostic URLs.
  CLAUDE.md: updated front-controller description, browser-agent section, admin
  route table.
  COMPATIBILITY.md: added clean URL requirement note to browser-agent section.
  bug_php_probe.md: full bug report documenting root cause, diagnosis, all four
  bugs found, and the fix.

