  - Changed the browserSnippet heredoc line from double-quoted to YAML
    single-quoted: browserSnippet: '${apmia_browser_snippet_yaml}'.
    YAML single-quoted strings allow embedded double-quotes without escaping.
  - Added comment explaining why single-quoting is required.

