2026-06-19 @ 09:00 - [Docs – require single quotes for APMIA_BROWSER_SNIPPET in .config.example]:
  Changed APMIA_BROWSER_SNIPPET="" to APMIA_BROWSER_SNIPPET='' and expanded
  the comment to explain why single quotes are mandatory: the snippet value is
  a <script> tag that contains double-quotes for HTML attributes.  Using double
  quotes around the variable causes the shell to treat those inner double-quotes
  as string terminators, silently corrupting the value.  Single quotes preserve
  the content verbatim.  An illustrative example line is included.

  File changed: .config.example

