2026-06-17 @ 11:00 - [Feat – Structured DX O2 agent identity via env vars]:
  The APM console was showing auto-detected Docker container hostnames and
  internal IPs instead of human-readable names.  Four new environment
  variables control every naming field for the IA, PHP probe, and BPA web
  plugin respectively.  All values are set through env vars – no profile or
  INI file is hard-coded.

  Mechanism (as documented by Broadcom):
    -Dintroscope.agent.customProcessName   → APMIA_PROCESS_NAME
    -Dcom.wily.introscope.agent.agentName  → APMIA_AGENT_NAME
    -Dintroscope.agent.application.name    → APMIA_APP_NAME
    -Dintroscope.agent.hostName            → APMIA_HOST_NAME
  JVM -D flags are injected into wrapper.conf (wrapper.java.additional.N)
  and the same values are patched into IntroscopeAgent.profile as a belt-
  and-suspenders measure.

  Defaults:
    APMIA_AGENT_NAME    = bpa-demo-agent
    APMIA_APP_NAME      = bpa-demo
    APMIA_HOST_NAME     = bpa-demo-host
    APMIA_PROCESS_NAME  = bpa-demo
    APMIA_PHP_AGENT_NAME = bpa-demo-php-probe
    APMIA_WEB_AGENT_NAME = bpa-demo-web-plugin

  src/dx-o2-agents/entrypoint.sh:
  - Added APMIA_HOST_NAME and APMIA_PROCESS_NAME variables.
  - Changed APMIA_APP_NAME default from BPA-Demo to bpa-demo (lowercase).
  - Added _set_profile_prop() helper; patches hostName and customProcessName
    into IntroscopeAgent.profile (handles commented-out and absent lines).
  - Added wrapper.conf JVM arg injection (_add_jvm_arg) for all four
    identity properties; gracefully skips if wrapper.conf is absent.
  - Fixed stale "nginx" comment in IPC address section.

  src/apache-php/entrypoint.sh:
  - Added APMIA_PHP_AGENT_NAME (bpa-demo-php-probe) and APMIA_WEB_AGENT_NAME
    (bpa-demo-web-plugin) variables.
  - Changed APMIA_APP_NAME default to bpa-demo.
  - Patches wily_php_agent.agentName in the INI (adds property if absent).
  - Exposes APMIA_WEB_AGENT_NAME to the BPA Apache module via
    SetEnv APMIA_WEB_AGENT_NAME in conf-enabled/bpa.conf.

  docker-compose.yml:
  - dxo2 service: added APMIA_HOST_NAME, APMIA_PROCESS_NAME; updated
    APMIA_AGENT_NAME default to bpa-demo-agent and APP_NAME to bpa-demo.
  - apachephp service: added APMIA_PHP_AGENT_NAME and APMIA_WEB_AGENT_NAME.

  helm/php-demo/values.yaml:
  - Added dxo2.hostName, dxo2.processName, dxo2.phpAgentName, dxo2.webAgentName.
  - Updated dxo2.appName default to bpa-demo.

