    Only project-supplied configurations remain active.
  - /etc/nginx/modules-enabled/ directory created and kept empty until
    the BPA entrypoint writes bpa.conf at runtime.
  - entrypoint.sh rewritten with BPA module injection block:
      Checks APMIA_HOME/extensions/WebServerPlugin/
        ngx_http_ca_plugin_filter_module.so.
      Writes load_module directive to /etc/nginx/modules-enabled/bpa.conf.
      Copies webserver_plugin.ini if present.
      Cleans up stale bpa.conf when volume is absent; starts without BPA.
  - nginx.conf updated: include /etc/nginx/modules-enabled/*.conf; added at
    the top-level scope (before events {}) as required by NGINX for dynamic
    module loading.  No-op when the directory is empty.

